- ACTION: Remove (or move into the side panel) the 'deshielded ← higher δ' magenta text, which is not present in the source and clutters the axis region.
- ACTION: Reduce the viewBox width (or increase font sizes ~1.5×) so axis numerals and band labels remain comfortably legible when the figure is scaled into the narrow inline column.
- ACTION: Extend the C—Hal band to ~85 ppm and re-check C≡C / C—O endpoints against the source bar extents; drop the corner radius so bars are square like the original.

